WEBVTT

00:00:29.035 --> 00:00:31.252
revolucionarizira medicinu,

00:00:31.252 --> 00:00:35.463
i dotakne svaki aspekt
našeg svakodnevnog života.

00:00:35.463 --> 00:00:39.295
I tko ima mogućnost to raditi?

00:00:39.295 --> 00:00:41.790
Mislim da bismo svi bili
poprilično zadovoljni

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:45.062
kada bi to radio ovaj čovjek.

00:00:45.062 --> 00:00:46.977
No što sa

00:00:46.977 --> 00:00:49.849
ovim tipom? (Smijeh)

00:00:49.849 --> 00:00:51.719
(Smijeh)

00:00:51.719 --> 00:00:57.193
2009. godine prvi sam put čula za DIYbio.

00:00:57.193 --> 00:01:01.306
To je pokret koji zagovara
izradu biotehnologije